<par def='3'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Admin Person</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/> - That staff person within the Section that has been given the responsibility of assigning order numbers, recording items as received in the Order Tracking database and reconciling the invoices received in the Order Tracking database.</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='1.2021in' rightmargin='93%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='4'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Link</run><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/> - A connection to another database, view or form that when clicked will take you directly to that database, view or form.  It may look like below.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
